            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:11:34.669131+00:00",
            "notes": "For this round, focus on making money, to do this make sure to be constantly healing your team as they are much easier to hit than the enemy and grants plenty of cash from assists, and in between look for damage options on enemies to further boost this.\n\nRemember that just because this is a Blaster build, you should still be lining up your Pulsars to hit multiple allies/enemies as often as you can, especially early on as this really boosts cash gain.\n\nYou can choose between [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) and [MediMaster](item_a04e1041-01c1-46ed-801e-d0590003e9b6), as both are great, but unless you have very good aim I find [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) to boost your damage more reliably, please note that [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) does not affect your heals though, whereas [MediMaster](item_a04e1041-01c1-46ed-801e-d0590003e9b6) will.\n\nEarly on the combination of [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) is optimal for heal and damage per second. Don't buy [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) as its effect on [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) at the moment is negligible and your Pulsars have a long cooldown with only one charge.\n\nIf you are worried about survival, then it may be worth buying [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da), [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa) and [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0). Don't buy [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) as it doesn't have the passive that [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) does and its damage reduction won't kick in until all of your shields are gone first",
