            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:11:34.669131+00:00",
            "notes": "Now that you have a decent amount of cash, pick the other power from [MediMaster](item_a04e1041-01c1-46ed-801e-d0590003e9b6) or [Stinger](item_e9d0d530-d620-4e74-a34d-38cdebfeb9a4) and also grab [Long Range Blaster](item_9dfc20e8-9a7b-4576-bdca-d75ada1b369b). You want to be playing within 12-25 metres of your team to make full use of [Long Range Blaster](item_9dfc20e8-9a7b-4576-bdca-d75ada1b369b), however this is still closer than it sounds so make sure to ping them every now and then to ensure you are close enough to proc the extra stats from it. Keep prioritising healing but now that you have [Long Range Blaster](item_9dfc20e8-9a7b-4576-bdca-d75ada1b369b) you can do some solid damage from the backline to the enemy team, and can fight back a lot more easily on anybody diving you.",
