            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:11:34.669131+00:00",
            "notes": "Here is where the build really picks up its heals, and pivots much more into burst healing. The combination of [Pulse Spike](item_6557a6d1-9c94-4635-9619-67257e26683e) and [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40) is very strong, and you will want to base your playstyle around this. Start off a fight by staying safe and shooting enemies, until your team takes some damage, then quickly make use of your [Pulsar Torpedoes](ability_fd63ee02-e01a-49bd-a75d-0e78efafca88) increased speed and heal boost, to then trigger a huge attack speed bonus and quickly burst them up to full health, then go back to shooting the enemy while your cooldown comes back. This doesn't mean to ignore your team while [Pulsar Torpedoes](ability_fd63ee02-e01a-49bd-a75d-0e78efafca88) are on cooldown, but remember that you can fix them up extremely quickly if they survive until your next cycle is ready.",
