            "notes": "You have some choices on what to pick for your powers now, I recommend [Pulsar Plus](item_4795ae1f-580d-47ec-a01d-0933cba56212) as this effectively halves the duration you have to wait between cycles, and greatly improves sustain for your team. [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) however is an honourable mention and can be good against something like a [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) diving your team, where what you really need is to get out as fast as possible, and the extra survivability helps to heal you as well as everyone else that has been dove.",
